I just mailed the patch #5 to the comp.sources.games moderator
for posting.  It should show up there in the next couple of days.

   The patch makes the following enhancements/bug fixes:

       o  utility program for displaying postscript maps.
       o  the map redisplay is now much more efficient.
       o  the newspaper reading facility is enhanced.
       o  god can now added or remove magics selectively.
       o  cheat() does not cheat for 'NPC' players who have moved.
       o  fixed major bugs with assigning of multiple magics on
           newlogins.
       o  added some NPC routines to have them obey magic power
           limitations.
       o  enhanced the makefile installation routines.

Most of the changes should be listed in the file 'notes.v4'.

For those who wish to grab it quickly, the patch is available
for anonymous ftp at bu-cs.bu.edu (128.197.2.1):
    ~ftp/src/conquer/patches/sharV4.5-*

Be sure to grab all three parts.

